TIP:  The pretty little intro and instrumental starts with (Gadd), then release the 2nd string for a regular (G).  After the (C) add your pinky to the 1st string/3rd fret and release.  If transposing, play the root chord of the transposed (CaddG) and (Gadd) and add the 5th note as necessary.

TIP:  At the end play an extra (G) and then pick the still-covered 1st string/third fret <g> to end the song.


